.DS_Store
.claude/

# Raster images are NOT tracked here. They live in Backblaze B2 — see images/README.md.
#
# Git stores meaning in text: a small edit to a document costs bytes and reads as that
# edit. A PNG has no diffable interior, so git stores a whole new multi-megabyte object
# and returns nothing for it. Art needs durability, not history, and that is a different
# problem with a different tool. Before this change the nine images were 24 MB of a 25 MB
# repository whose text packs to under 900 KB.
#
# Author's ruling, 2026-08-05. Bucket haishuo-writing-images, prefix psion-the-fraying/,
# with B2 file versioning on. Restore with `./sync_art.sh pull --yes`.
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.webp
*.gif
